  "title": "TV: Paul McCartney on Saturday Night Live | 2025",
  "date": "2025-02-16",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p><a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> performed on <em>Saturday Night Live</em>’s 50th anniversary special on Sunday 16 February 2025. <span id=\"more-126331\"></span></p><p>The show was part of a three-hour special to celebrate <em>SNL</em>’s 50th season, broadcast on NBC and Peacock.</p><p>McCartney’s band was Paul ‘Wix’ Wickens (vocals, keyboards, guitar, percussion, harmonica), Brian Ray (vocals, guitar, bass), Rusty Anderson (vocals, guitar), Abe Laboriel Jr (vocals, drums), Kenji Fenton (saxophone), Mike Davis (trumpet), and Paul Burton (trombone).</p><div class=\"epyt-video-wrapper\"><iframe id=\"_ytid_53595\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\" data-origwidth=\"580\" data-origheight=\"326\" data-relstop=\"1\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BFj_AOlvy5A?enablejsapi=1&amp;autoplay=0&amp;cc_load_policy=0&amp;cc_lang_pref=&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;loop=0&amp;rel=0&amp;fs=1&amp;playsinline=0&amp;autohide=2&amp;theme=dark&amp;color=red&amp;controls=1&amp;disablekb=0&amp;\" class=\"__youtube_prefs__  epyt-is-override  no-lazyload\" title=\"YouTube player\" allow=\"fullscreen; accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-no-lazy=\"1\" data-skipgform_ajax_framebjll=\"\"></iframe></div><p>Introduced by Martin Short, they performed three songs: <a href=\"/songs/golden-slumbers/\">‘Golden Slumbers’</a>, <a href=\"/songs/carry-that-weight/\">‘Carry That Weight’</a>, and <a href=\"/songs/the-end/\">‘The End’</a>. The other musical performers included Paul Simon and Sabrina Carpenter, who played ‘Homeward Bound’, a song performed by Simon and <a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a> on <em>SNL</em>’s 20 November 1976 episode.</p><p>McCartney previously performed on <em>Saturday Night Live</em> on 17 May 1980, 13 February 1993, 11 December 2010, and 15 December 2012. He was the show’s special guest on 15 February 2015, and made cameo appearances on 11 November 2006, 21 December 2013, and 19 December 2015.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/2025/02/16/tv-paul-mccartney-saturday-night-live-9/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-126331 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/250216-paul-mccartney-saturday-night-live_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTEzIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDExMyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"113\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/250216-paul-mccartney-saturday-night-live_01-200x113.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul McCartney on Saturday Night Live, 16 February 2025\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/250216-paul-mccartney-saturday-night-live_01-200x113.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/250216-paul-mccartney-saturday-night-live_01-580x326.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/250216-paul-mccartney-saturday-night-live_01-960x540.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/250216-paul-mccartney-saturday-night-live_01-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/250216-paul-mccartney-saturday-night-live_01-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/250216-paul-mccartney-saturday-night-live_01.jpg 1920w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"126336\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/250216-paul-mccartney-saturday-night-live_01/\" data-orig-fi