ge-harrison-arrive-in-rishikesh/\">John Lennon and George Harrison arrive in Rishikesh</a></li><li>1967: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/02/16/recording-mixing-good-morning-good-morning/\">Recording, mixing: Good Morning Good Morning</a></li><li>1965: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1965/02/16/recording-i-need-you-another-girl-yes-it-is/\">Recording: I Need You, Another Girl, Yes It Is</a></li><li>1964: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/02/16/beatles-ed-sullivan-show/\">The Beatles’ second Ed Sullivan Show</a></li><li>1963: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/02/16/live-carfax-assembly-rooms-oxford/\">The Beatles live: Carfax Assembly Rooms, Oxford</a></li><li>1963: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/02/16/please-please-me-cover-photoshoot/\">Please Please Me cover photoshoot</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/02/16/live-tower-ballroom-new-brighton-wallasey-11/\">The Beatles live: Tower Ballroom, New Brighton, Wallasey</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/02/16/live-technical-college-hall-birkenhead-2/\">The Beatles live: Technical College Hall, Birkenhead</a></li><li>1961: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1961/02/16/live-litherland-town-hall-liverpool-6/\">The Beatles live: Litherland Town Hall, Liverpool</a></li><li>1961: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1961/02/16/live-cassanova-club-liverpool-3/\">The Beatles live: Cassanova Club, Liverpool</a></li></ul><p>Want more? Visit the <a title=\"Day after day: the Beatles' history\" href=\"/history/\">Beatles history section</a>.</p></div><div class=\"gm-map\" style=\"position: relative;height: 390px; width: 100%;\"><iframe data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"about:blank\" name=\"gm-map-1\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/?geo_mashup_content=render-map&amp;map_data_key=d91ea94b59ce66d69e363f79dd6eafb6&amp;height=390&amp;width=100%&amp;add_overview_control=false&amp;zoom=16&amp;enable_street_view=false&amp;map_type=G_HYBRID_MAP&amp;name=gm-map-1&amp;object_id=126331&amp;map_content=single\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; overflow: hidden;\" title=\"Geo Mashup Map\"></iframe></div>",
  "textContent": "Paul McCartney performed on Saturday Night Live’s 50th anniversary special on Sunday 16 February 2025. The show was part of a three-hour special to celebrate SNL’s 50th season, broadcast on NBC and Peacock.McCartney’s band was Paul ‘Wix’ Wickens (vocals, keyboards, guitar, percussion, harmonica), Brian Ray (vocals, guitar, bass), Rusty Anderson (vocals, guitar), Abe Laboriel Jr (vocals, drums), Kenji Fenton (saxophone), Mike Davis (trumpet), and Paul Burton (trombone).Introduced by Martin Short, they performed three songs: ‘Golden Slumbers’, ‘Carry That Weight’, and ‘The End’. The other musical performers included Paul Simon and Sabrina Carpenter, who played ‘Homeward Bound’, a song performed by Simon and George Harrison on SNL’s 20 November 1976 episode.McCartney previously performed on Saturday Night Live on 17 May 1980, 13 February 1993, 11 December 2010, and 15 December 2012. He was the show’s special guest on 15 February 2015, and made cameo appearances on 11 November 2006, 21 December 2013, and 19 December 2015.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPage last updated: 15 September 2026Also on this day...2013: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Festival Hall, Melbourne1999: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Beacon Theatre, New York City1979: Mixing: Reception by Wings1977: Photography: John Lennon and Yoko Ono in Stockbridge, USA1977: Recording: London Town by Wings1976: Recording: Cook Of The House by Wings1973: Sequencing: Red Rose Speedway by Wings1973: The Beatles file lawsuit to stop Alpha Omega compilation1972: Wings live: Town Hall, Leeds1972: Recording: Woman Is The N****r Of The World by John Lennon and Yoko Ono1971: Recording:  I Don’t Want To Be A Soldier, Well (Baby Please Don’t Go) by John Lennon1970: Tape copying: McCartney by Paul McCartney1968: John Lennon and George Harrison arrive in Rishikesh1967: Recording, mixing: Good Morning Good Morning1965: Recording: I Need You, Another Girl, Yes It Is1964: The Beatles’ second Ed Sullivan Show1963: The Beatles live: Carfax Assembly Rooms, Oxford1963: Please Please Me cover photoshoot1962: The Beatles live: Tower Ballroom, New Brighton, Wallasey1962: The Beatles live: Technical College Hall, Birkenhead1961: The Beatles live: Litherland Town Hall, Liverpool1961: The Beatles live: Cassanova Club, LiverpoolWant more? Visit the Beatles history section.",
